WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.034
-I don't know if you guy
saw this,

00:00:02.034 --> 00:00:03.302
but I just read

00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:04.703
Dollar Tree is planning to open

00:00:04.703 --> 00:00:06.572
600 new stores this year.

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:08.875
-What?!
-That's a pretty big expansion.

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:11.477
I think it deserves
a little appreciation.

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:14.948
In fact, right now,
I'd like to sing an ode

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:15.948
to dollar stores.
Roots.

00:00:15.948 --> 00:00:18.651
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:21.220
♪♪

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.755
♪ Dollar store ♪

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:24.857
♪ Oh, dollar store ♪

00:00:24.857 --> 00:00:26.025
♪ Weirder stuff ♪

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:27.627
♪ Than I bargained for ♪

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:29.195
♪ Like calendars ♪

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:30.797
♪ That are one year off ♪

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:32.298
♪ And generic candy ♪

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:34.400
♪ That makes me cough ♪

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.136
[ Laughter ]
[ Coughs ]

00:00:37.136 --> 00:00:38.438
♪ Dollar store ♪

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:40.106
♪ Sweet dollar store ♪

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:41.174
♪ Greeting cards ♪

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:42.942
♪ With typos galore ♪

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:44.177
♪ I love to search ♪

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:45.611
♪ Your crowded halls ♪

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:47.246
♪ For a bin of off-brand ♪

00:00:47.246 --> 00:00:48.748
♪ Barbie dolls ♪

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:49.949
♪ Dollar store ♪

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:51.451
♪ My dollar store ♪

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.085
♪ Even though the quality ♪

00:00:53.085 --> 00:00:54.287
♪ May be poor ♪

00:00:54.287 --> 00:00:55.588
♪ There's a cheapness that ♪

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:57.023
♪ I can't ignore ♪

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:59.058
♪ And you know that I'll be ♪

00:00:59.058 --> 00:01:01.460
♪ Back for more ♪

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:02.529
♪ Oh, dollar ♪

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:05.498
♪ Store ♪

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:06.899
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:01:06.899 --> 00:01:08.201
Stick around!
We'll be right back

00:01:08.201 --> 00:01:11.170
with Tracy Morgan
and "Tonight Show Hashtags"!

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:21.180
♪♪

